          "description": "**参数解释**:\n字段类型\n- text 全文索引字段\n- keyword 关键字类型,适用于精确匹配\n- long 长整型\n- integer 整型\n- double 双精度浮点数\n- float 单精度浮点数\n- date 日期类型\n\n**约束限制**\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n- text\n- keyword\n- long\n- integer\n- double\n- float\n- date\n\n**默认值**\n不涉及",
          "enum": [
            "text",
            "keyword",
            "long",
            "integer",
            "double",
            "float",
            "date"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "BadRequest": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "error_code": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "SecMaster.00000001",
          "description": "错误码",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 128
        },
        "error_msg": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "无效请求提示信息",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 128
        }
      }
